    30	#   one target-colored side arm giving left-vs-right mirror state.
    31	# - Example trace:
    32	#   * Original task: translate one connected teal component from the legend anchor
    33	#     onto every scattered source pixel with no orientation change.
    34	#   * Fused task: first merge several nearby teal islands into one fragmented local
    35	#     stencil; then, for a seed whose same-color arm points east and whose side arm
    36	#     sits south, rotate that whole fragmented stencil to point east and mirror it
    37	#     across the forward axis before stamping it at the seed center.
