    43	# - A fragmented but symmetric stencil would visually collapse the rotation signal,
    44	#   so the generator only emits unions whose 8 dihedral transforms are all distinct.
    45	# - Every rule has at least 2 teal fragments and at least 3 scattered seeds; the
    46	#   seed variants deliberately include both mirror states plus multiple directions.
    47	# - The fragment count stays small and local (radius-2 window) so the grouping task
    48	#   is visible but not noisy.
